cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "A depth-111 phase oracle for the Classiq logo"
abstract: >-
  An 18-qubit U3/CX circuit of depth 111 (557 CX) implementing the phase oracle of the
  Classiq Quantum Circuit Challenge, built from class codes, conditional loaders, a 63-term
  phase kernel and exact scheduling. All circuits are verified exhaustively on 4,096 inputs.
authors:
